    dec:["Vomiting or nasogastric suction (loss of gastric HCl)","Loop and thiazide diuretics","Metabolic alkalosis of any cause","SIADH and other dilutional states","Chronic respiratory acidosis (compensatory)"],
    interf:["Bromide and iodide cross-react with some ion-selective electrodes and falsely raise chloride."],
