      items:["Request only after a confirmed prolonged PT or APTT on a properly collected sample — repeat the abnormal test first to exclude a pre-analytical artefact.","State whether the patient is on any anticoagulant; heparin and DOACs make the study uninterpretable.","The laboratory needs to perform both an immediate and a 1–2 h incubated reading."],
