    prep:{ fasting:"Preferred (morning sample)",
      items:["ALWAYS collect a simultaneous calcium (and ideally albumin, phosphate and vitamin D). PTH without a paired calcium is uninterpretable.","Collect in the morning — PTH shows diurnal variation with a nocturnal peak.","Record vitamin D status, renal function, lithium and thiazides."],
      patient:["Come in the morning for this test, fasting if your doctor has asked.","You will also have a calcium test from the same sample — both are needed together."] },
