    prep:{ fasting:"Not required",
      items:["Record SMOKING STATUS — smokers have substantially higher baseline CEA and a separate reference range.","Note any inflammatory bowel disease, liver disease, pancreatitis or recent chemotherapy.","Obtain a baseline before surgery for colorectal cancer; the post-operative trend is what carries the information."],
      patient:["Tell the doctor whether you smoke — it affects this result."] },
